  (text
    "USB5744 (Microchip DS00001855J): SMBus slave mode (10k PU on SMCLK/SMDAT, sec 3.4.1), CFG_NON_REM 10k PU = ports 1-3 non-removable,\nCFG_BC_EN 200k PD = no battery charging, port 4 disabled (PRT_DIS_P4/M4 to 3.3V). VBUS_DET via 49.9k/100k divider (detachable upstream).\nVDD12 from +1V2 buck (688mA typ, 4 SS ports). RBIAS 12k 1%. 25MHz crystal. PRT_CTLx unused (slot power is switched by the 3.7V bucks).\nUpstream USB-C (UFP only): HD3SS3220 PORT=GND (UFP), ADDR=NC (GPIO mode), ENn_CC/ENn_MUX=GND; it presents Rd and muxes SS by plug orientation.\n  VDD5 is taken from VBUS (UFP-only design; VERIFY with TI that VBUS-powered VDD5 is acceptable - else add a 5V rail).\nHub upstream TX AC caps 100nF between hub and mux; hub downstream TX caps 100nF on this sheet (slot RX).\nESD: TPD4EUSB30 on SS pairs + D+/D-/CC at the connector; SMAJ5.0A on VBUS."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 382 0)
